records.omission_quote:
We propose a replication on the effect of the time of day on variety-seeking behavior, given the results from the two papers were different and there were some limitations of the previous research. For example, Roehm and Roehm (
2004
) used small samples of students and one product category (candy bars) that limits generalizability while Gullo et al. (
2019
) used households in their first study that could mask individual behavior.
